38,"typeText":"∀ {α : Type u_1} {p : α → Bool} (l₁ l₂ : List.{u_1} α),\n  Eq.{u_1 + 1} (List.filter.{u_1} p (HAppend.hAppend.{u_1, u_1, u_1} l₁ l₂))\n    (HAppend.hAppend.{u_1, u_1, u_1} (List.filter.{u_1} p l₁) (List.filter.{u_1} p l₂))","unsafe":false,"value":470,"source":{"code":"@[simp, grind =] theorem filter_append {p : α → Bool} :\n    ∀ (l₁ l₂ : List α), filter p (l₁ ++ l₂) = filter p l₁ ++ filter p l₂\n  | [], _ => rfl\n  | a :: l₁, l₂ => by simp only [cons_append, filter]; split <;> simp [filter_append l₁]","start":1335,"end":1338},"axioms":["propext"]}